obj_id: RegionalProfitabilityDiscovery-25c9c208
liveboard:
  name: Regional Profitability Discovery
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: abaeb31d-6118-4f07-b9ba-12a0dee54733
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West Region leads with $725K sales and 14.9% profit margin - highest performance
        • Central Region shows concerning 7.9% profit margin despite $501K in sales
        • East Region maintains strong $679K sales with healthy 13.5% profitability
        • South Region has lowest sales volume at $392K but reasonable 11.9% margin

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central Region's low profitability - analyze pricing and cost structure
        • Replicate West Region's successful practices across other regions
        • Focus growth investments in South Region to scale up sales volume
